WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:49.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:50.185 --> 01:51.265
Chen Yanzhou.

3
01:51.945 --> 01:53.385
Actually,

4
01:54.025 --> 01:56.945
there's something I've been wanting to ask you these past few days.

5
01:58.425 --> 01:59.345
You…

6
02:12.745 --> 02:14.305
Another dream?

7
02:20.065 --> 02:21.345
I really miss you.

8
02:50.665 --> 02:52.785
ZHENG YU

9
02:52.865 --> 02:54.585
Sorry about last night.

10
03:09.185 --> 03:12.265
TO-DO LIST: HERBURG BUSINESS TRIP

11
04:43.745 --> 04:45.625
To avoid being disturbed.

12
05:11.305 --> 05:12.145
CHEN YANZHOU

13
05:12.225 --> 05:14.465
I'm leaving today for a two-day business trip to Herburg.

14
05:14.545 --> 05:15.825
I'll see you when I get back.

15
05:24.785 --> 05:25.945
ZHENG YU

16
05:26.025 --> 05:26.945
Okay.

17
07:26.505 --> 07:28.505
BERLIN INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS' SECOND-HAND MARKET

18
07:28.585 --> 07:31.225
Is anyone near TU Berlin selling a doorstop?

19
09:56.625 --> 09:59.105
Chen Yanzhou, when will you be back?

20
10:01.265 --> 10:05.025
I'm leaving Herburg tomorrow at three. Should be back in Berlin around five.

21
10:10.025 --> 10:12.465
What's wrong? Did something happen?

22
10:17.625 --> 10:18.945
I'll wait for you to get back.

23
10:22.905 --> 10:25.665
There are a few things I want to clear up in person.

24
10:28.585 --> 10:29.745
All right.

25
10:39.225 --> 10:42.745
That's all for today's class.

26
10:42.825 --> 10:46.425
I hope all of you have a great rest of your day!

27
10:52.185 --> 10:53.705
Did you hear?

28
10:53.785 --> 10:55.585
There was a shooting!

29
10:55.665 --> 10:56.865
When did it happen?

30
10:56.945 --> 10:58.425
About an hour ago, I think.

31
10:58.505 --> 11:00.425
Did they catch the shooter?

32
11:00.505 --> 11:04.185
If they haven't, I'm definitely not going to Herburg this weekend.

33
12:27.425 --> 12:29.345
-Hello. -Zheng Yu.

34
12:33.345 --> 12:34.665
Chen Yanzhou.

35
12:35.305 --> 12:38.265
I saw the news about the shooting at Herburg Station.

36
12:38.345 --> 12:39.545
I saw it too.

37
12:39.625 --> 12:40.665
I'm safe.

38
12:40.745 --> 12:42.065
I'm already in Berlin.

39
12:42.145 --> 12:45.065
I missed your call earlier. The signal was probably bad.

40
12:50.905 --> 12:51.745
Hello?

41
12:57.905 --> 12:58.785
I want to see you.

42
13:02.225 --> 13:04.865
I want to see you too. Where are you?

43
13:04.945 --> 13:05.945
I'll come to you.

44
13:06.665 --> 13:09.265
I'm waiting for the subway, about to head to the train station.

45
13:09.945 --> 13:11.025
The train station?

46
13:12.465 --> 13:15.225
Were you coming to find me?

47
13:16.665 --> 13:18.025
Were you worried about me?

48
13:19.425 --> 13:20.625
I just wanted to see you sooner.

49
13:26.465 --> 13:28.665
I'm still on the bus heading back to the institute.

50
13:28.745 --> 13:30.145
Let's meet up at a station halfway.

51
13:30.225 --> 13:31.905
Get off after three stops.

52
13:31.985 --> 13:33.825
At that station, transfer to another line.

53
13:33.905 --> 13:35.545
Then get off after four more stops.

54
13:36.185 --> 13:37.945
We'll meet in front of the cathedral.

55
13:54.105 --> 13:54.985
Good luck.

56
15:24.065 --> 15:25.185
Are we

57
15:25.265 --> 15:26.265
completely crazy?

58
15:28.185 --> 15:29.145
Maybe.

59
15:33.745 --> 15:35.705
-I have something to tell you. -Me too.

60
15:35.785 --> 15:36.665
Let me go first.

61
15:42.025 --> 15:43.185
Chen Yanzhou.

62
15:43.905 --> 15:45.065
Actually,

63
15:46.145 --> 15:47.905
I've had feelings for you for a long time.

64
15:52.225 --> 15:55.425
Maybe it was that day at the campsite,

65
15:56.025 --> 15:58.505
when I realized you'd given me your jacket.

66
16:00.185 --> 16:04.145
Maybe it was when you fought for me, and I saw your wounds.

67
16:07.425 --> 16:09.985
Or maybe it was when I confronted you

68
16:10.065 --> 16:13.345
and saw the way you looked at me, so resolute.

69
16:14.305 --> 16:16.665
I kept asking myself whether I should love,

70
16:17.385 --> 16:21.025
whether I should let someone become part of my entire life…

71
16:24.225 --> 16:27.385
even if my emotions were constantly affected by him,

72
16:28.145 --> 16:30.265
even if part of who I am

73
16:30.345 --> 16:31.785
might change because of him.

74
16:33.585 --> 16:35.545
I backed away so many times,

75
16:36.185 --> 16:39.065
but you always bravely came toward me.

76
16:40.345 --> 16:44.345
Slowly, I realized that in every moment of hesitation,

77
16:44.425 --> 16:47.065
my hesitation itself was the answer.

78
16:52.185 --> 16:53.305
Chen Yanzhou.

79
16:54.905 --> 16:56.065
I like you.

80
17:02.585 --> 17:03.905
But

81
17:03.985 --> 17:06.585
there are some things I need to make clear first.

82
17:06.665 --> 17:10.545
I'm the kind of person who overcomplicates things.

83
17:10.625 --> 17:11.985
I know.

84
17:12.065 --> 17:14.145
And I tend to say the opposite of what I mean.

85
17:14.224 --> 17:16.184
What's on my mind is one thing,

86
17:16.265 --> 17:19.105
but what comes out of my mouth is something else entirely.

87
17:19.184 --> 17:21.265
But you expressed yourself so well just now.

88
17:21.345 --> 17:22.665
I…

89
17:22.745 --> 17:24.065
I'm also very conflicted.

90
17:24.145 --> 17:27.985
I want to get closer to you, but I'm afraid of getting hurt.

91
17:28.065 --> 17:30.545
But you're being so brave now.

92
17:33.425 --> 17:37.145
I might end up exhausting you, making you guess what I'm thinking.

93
17:37.225 --> 17:39.785
Conveniently enough, I have a lot of patience.

94
17:40.985 --> 17:43.145
I'm not good at sweet-talk either.

95
17:43.225 --> 17:46.745
Once we've been together a while, you might find me really boring.

96
17:46.825 --> 17:47.825
Is that so?

97
17:47.905 --> 17:51.305
Then why do I feel like ever since I met you,

98
17:51.385 --> 17:52.545
I've been smiling all the time?

99
18:01.225 --> 18:03.305
Do you have any other questions?

100
18:04.065 --> 18:05.305
Just one more.

101
18:05.385 --> 18:08.265
Didn't you say earlier that you had something to tell me?

102
18:08.345 --> 18:09.865
What was it?

103
18:10.665 --> 18:12.305
-I forgot. -You…

104
18:13.305 --> 18:14.505
I remember now.

105
18:16.785 --> 18:18.025
You said that

106
18:18.105 --> 18:20.465
some things should wait until we're sober.

107
18:21.665 --> 18:23.945
I'm completely sober right now.

108
19:18.185 --> 19:19.385
I'm here.

109
19:25.825 --> 19:28.905
I'll head upstairs now.

110
19:31.065 --> 19:32.345
Well,

111
19:32.425 --> 19:33.305
see you tomorrow then.

112
19:36.145 --> 19:37.425
I have classes all day tomorrow.

113
19:39.385 --> 19:40.425
What time do they end?

114
19:42.305 --> 19:43.505
Three o'clock.

115
19:44.105 --> 19:45.985
Then I'll pick you up at 3.01 p.m.

116
19:47.785 --> 19:50.625
So you're only giving me one minute to run back to my dorm?

117
19:54.025 --> 19:56.185
So what are you planning to do?

118
20:03.305 --> 20:04.985
Hold your hand for day two.

119
20:07.305 --> 20:09.305
Then I'll try

120
20:09.385 --> 20:10.625
to run faster.

121
20:11.385 --> 20:12.385
Okay.

122
20:14.025 --> 20:15.065
Go on upstairs.

123
20:15.905 --> 20:17.065
Good night.

124
20:18.705 --> 20:19.545
Good night.

125
21:03.025 --> 21:04.265
TIMER

126
21:08.065 --> 21:09.305
It's been an hour.

127
21:09.385 --> 21:10.465
Are you home yet?

128
21:12.785 --> 21:13.665
Just got back.

129
21:13.745 --> 21:14.785
Opening the door.

130
21:16.185 --> 21:17.345
I'm inside.

131
21:19.385 --> 21:20.465
Turning on the lights.

132
21:20.985 --> 21:22.105
Taking off my shoes.

133
21:22.745 --> 21:24.065
Sitting down on the sofa.

134
21:26.385 --> 21:27.585
What are you doing?

135
21:29.785 --> 21:31.385
Reporting to my girlfriend!

136
21:49.945 --> 21:53.065
You have an early class tomorrow. Why are you still awake?

137
21:54.665 --> 21:55.665
I can't sleep.

138
21:56.785 --> 21:58.665
Don't tell me you have insomnia.

139
22:05.465 --> 22:07.505
Of course not. I'm going to sleep now.

140
22:08.625 --> 22:09.505
Good night.

141
22:18.305 --> 22:19.145
Good night.

142
22:23.505 --> 22:24.545
Good night.

143
22:29.025 --> 22:29.945
Good night.

144
22:34.305 --> 22:35.225
Good night.

145
22:43.945 --> 22:45.025
Good night.

146
23:18.305 --> 23:20.905
Could he already be here?

147
23:20.985 --> 23:22.065
I shouldn't be late, right?

148
23:24.585 --> 23:25.465
What are you doing here?

149
23:26.625 --> 23:28.945
I couldn't really make you run back in one minute.

150
23:34.065 --> 23:34.905
Let's exchange.

151
23:38.305 --> 23:40.225
I didn't prepare a gift.

152
23:44.545 --> 23:45.825
I meant this.

153
23:56.225 --> 23:57.705
Didn't you sleep well last night?

154
23:57.785 --> 23:58.865
It's not that.

155
24:00.425 --> 24:03.385
My next-door roommate is just too noisy.

156
24:03.465 --> 24:06.105
She keeps bringing friends over to throw parties.

157
24:06.185 --> 24:07.025
Parties?

158
24:07.905 --> 24:10.145
Then why don't you find another place?

159
24:10.225 --> 24:11.105
It's fine.

160
24:11.185 --> 24:13.545
I'll find some time to have a proper talk with her.

161
24:14.465 --> 24:15.425
Or…

162
24:15.505 --> 24:16.825
would you like me to help?

163
24:18.985 --> 24:21.105
It's okay. I can handle it myself.

164
24:23.585 --> 24:25.305
If anything happens, you have to call me.

165
24:25.385 --> 24:26.785
No matter how small it is.

166
24:28.065 --> 24:28.945
Got it.

167
24:30.825 --> 24:32.345
What do you want to eat today?

168
24:33.105 --> 24:34.065
Chinese food.

169
24:34.145 --> 24:37.385
I've been here for so many days, and I'm really craving Chinese food.

170
24:42.065 --> 24:44.705
I know a chef who's an amazing cook.

171
24:46.705 --> 24:49.865
So the chef you're talking about is actually you?

172
24:52.305 --> 24:54.225
Why? Scared it won't taste good?

173
24:55.025 --> 24:55.865
No.

174
24:56.905 --> 24:58.705
I've spent the past year practicing really hard.

175
24:59.665 --> 25:01.705
Then I'm looking forward to it.

176
25:05.065 --> 25:07.225
Is there anything I can help with?

177
25:07.305 --> 25:08.145
No need.

178
25:08.225 --> 25:10.265
You're my guest today. All you have to do is wait.

179
25:10.905 --> 25:12.225
Just sit on the sofa.

180
26:12.225 --> 26:13.425
I wasn't lying, was I?

181
26:14.185 --> 26:15.705
I underestimated you.

182
26:18.105 --> 26:18.985
By the way,

183
26:19.065 --> 26:21.545
make me a list of all your favorite foods.

184
26:24.665 --> 26:26.745
Otherwise, how are you going to order food every day?

185
26:28.505 --> 26:31.145
You're just trying to trick me into eating at your place every day.

186
26:33.065 --> 26:35.825
Then would you be willing to come over for dinner every day?

187
26:40.025 --> 26:41.865
Never mind. My place is too far.

188
26:42.385 --> 26:44.905
How about I deliver meals to you every day?

189
26:46.025 --> 26:47.745
Then how much is the delivery fee?

190
26:49.585 --> 26:50.825
Aside from money,

191
26:50.905 --> 26:53.145
you can pay however you see fit.

192
26:57.665 --> 26:59.065
Eat up.

193
27:01.745 --> 27:03.065
Try this.

194
27:03.145 --> 27:04.865
It's Chef Xiaozhou's signature dish.

195
27:07.865 --> 27:09.585
-Cheers. -Cheers.

196
27:24.065 --> 27:25.905
Do you like this flower?

197
27:25.985 --> 27:27.705
Then wrap this one up and take it back.

198
27:29.225 --> 27:30.585
I don't have a vase in my room.

199
27:32.385 --> 27:34.545
You were just spacing out, thinking about this?

200
27:36.145 --> 27:37.225
No.

201
27:37.305 --> 27:39.225
I was thinking…

202
27:41.945 --> 27:43.105
Chen Yanzhou,

203
27:43.185 --> 27:45.465
you seem really good at dating.

204
27:49.145 --> 27:52.425
When holding hands, you know the perfect timing.

205
27:52.505 --> 27:54.825
When going on dates, you pick great spots.

206
27:54.905 --> 27:58.425
You're good at expressing yourself, and you know how to be romantic.

207
27:59.265 --> 28:01.945
You must have a lot of experience.

208
28:07.745 --> 28:09.105
What if I told you

209
28:09.825 --> 28:11.545
this was my first time?

210
28:11.625 --> 28:12.745
Would you believe me?

211
28:14.945 --> 28:16.065
Not really.

212
28:17.825 --> 28:19.425
Then what if I told you

213
28:19.505 --> 28:21.345
I learned it all from movies?

214
28:21.425 --> 28:22.625
Would you believe me?

215
28:24.585 --> 28:26.345
-Movies? -That's right.

216
28:26.425 --> 28:28.145
Don't all those old movies do things this way?

217
28:28.225 --> 28:31.065
I just happen to be a good student.

218
28:32.985 --> 28:35.945
Well, I probably wouldn't get a very high score

219
28:36.825 --> 28:38.025
in that department.

220
28:42.625 --> 28:43.705
Zheng Yu.

221
28:46.465 --> 28:48.665
Let me share a secret with you on how to get a high score.

222
28:49.985 --> 28:51.145
What is it?

223
28:52.265 --> 28:54.785
Laugh whenever you feel like laughing.

224
28:54.865 --> 28:56.185
Say whatever you feel like saying.

225
28:56.785 --> 28:58.585
Rub your hands if you're nervous.

226
28:58.665 --> 29:00.665
Tell me what you want to eat when you're hungry.

227
29:00.745 --> 29:01.905
Come find me when you're bored.

228
29:03.345 --> 29:06.025
If you want to ask if I have experience, just ask directly.

229
29:06.105 --> 29:09.985
Isn't that exactly what I'm doing right now?

230
29:10.065 --> 29:11.745
Exactly. So you see?

231
29:11.825 --> 29:13.905
Aren't you already doing an amazing job?

232
29:16.065 --> 29:17.185
Nonsense.

233
29:19.225 --> 29:20.945
No. It's the truth.

234
29:22.745 --> 29:23.865
Just be yourself.

235
29:23.945 --> 29:27.785
I'll learn everything else and take care of it.

236
29:29.145 --> 29:31.625
Then I'll do my best to learn too.

237
29:48.025 --> 29:50.745
Ms. Zheng's learning ability is impressive indeed.

238
29:50.825 --> 29:53.665
Looks like I'll have to take back what I said.

239
29:53.745 --> 29:55.345
Some things

240
29:55.425 --> 29:57.545
really do require learning together.

241
29:58.345 --> 29:59.465
Haven't we washed the dishes?

242
29:59.545 --> 30:01.025
I… I'll wash them.

243
30:02.305 --> 30:04.265
Didn't you say we should keep learning?

244
30:04.345 --> 30:07.065
-Ms. Zheng, you need to study hard! -I didn't say that!

245
30:07.145 --> 30:08.905
Come on. Let me wash them.

246
30:08.985 --> 30:13.025
-Don't move. I'll do it. -This is not the kind of learning I meant.

247
30:27.145 --> 30:28.545
Are you in the classroom yet?

248
30:28.625 --> 30:30.225
CHEN YANZHOU

249
30:30.305 --> 30:31.145
Yes.

250
30:31.865 --> 30:33.425
I hope the lecturer for this class

251
30:33.505 --> 30:36.545
won't randomly blurt out German phrases in the middle of lecturing in English.

252
30:36.625 --> 30:39.905
ZHENG YU

253
31:08.105 --> 31:12.305
The lecturer in my last class today wore two different socks.

254
31:12.385 --> 31:14.145
One black, one brown.

255
31:14.225 --> 31:16.065
I had such a hard time holding back my laughter.

256
31:16.145 --> 31:19.425
Do you think he did it on purpose or by accident?

257
32:24.425 --> 32:27.345
REALLY WANT TO GO BACK TO BERLIN EARLY

258
33:25.665 --> 33:27.065
I've received it.

259
33:27.145 --> 33:29.065
CHEN YANZHOU

260
33:29.145 --> 33:30.945
You just received it today?

261
33:31.025 --> 33:33.185
The German postal service really breaks your heart.

262
33:33.905 --> 33:35.545
Are you done with your experiment?

263
33:36.385 --> 33:38.385
Not yet. Just taking a three-minute break.

264
33:41.105 --> 33:42.625
Sounds so exhausting.

265
33:42.705 --> 33:44.585
Next time, I'll go visit you instead.

266
33:48.865 --> 33:50.865
When is the next time?

267
33:54.305 --> 33:55.665
Tomorrow.

268
33:55.745 --> 33:57.545
It's the weekend, and I'm free.

269
34:00.545 --> 34:02.785
I've read this message three times.

270
34:07.465 --> 34:08.705
And?

271
34:11.145 --> 34:14.425
I felt like getting scolded by my advisor today didn't even matter anymore.

272
34:16.744 --> 34:18.824
Get some rest early. See you tomorrow.

273
34:20.744 --> 34:21.905
See you tomorrow.

274
35:11.425 --> 35:16.945
ZHENG YU: SEE YOU TOMORROW.

275
36:05.145 --> 36:06.105
Hello.

276
36:06.185 --> 36:07.145
Chen Yanzhou…

277
36:08.265 --> 36:10.065
Don't panic. I'm on my way.

278
36:12.105 --> 36:13.065
Wait for me.

279
36:25.505 --> 36:27.505
CHEN YANZHOU

280
37:36.985 --> 37:37.865
Chen Yanzhou!

281
37:46.465 --> 37:47.305
Sorry I'm late.

282
37:48.385 --> 37:49.225
Were they chasing you?

283
37:51.105 --> 37:52.345
They didn't catch up.

284
38:07.305 --> 38:08.425
How did you get out?

285
38:09.025 --> 38:11.785
I used a lighter and triggered the fire alarm.

286
38:12.465 --> 38:15.145
Our dorm has an interconnected wireless alarm system.

287
38:15.225 --> 38:17.825
When one alarm goes off, all the others go off too.

288
38:17.905 --> 38:21.105
They seem like heavy smokers, so I just used it to my advantage.

289
38:22.705 --> 38:25.825
They'll have to pay the fee for the fire department dispatch, though.

290
38:26.585 --> 38:29.585
But at least I helped eliminate a safety hazard in the dorm.

291
38:30.705 --> 38:33.145
They were actually going to chase after me,

292
38:33.225 --> 38:34.985
but they picked the wrong person.

293
38:35.065 --> 38:37.065
I used to get chased by Wu Fa's gang every single day.

294
38:37.145 --> 38:38.385
I run way faster than them.

295
39:10.585 --> 39:11.665
Let's go home.

296
39:12.465 --> 39:13.945
The car is parked pretty far away.

297
39:14.025 --> 39:16.025
Those shoes won't be comfortable to walk in.

298
39:40.665 --> 39:42.265
You can stay here comfortably.

299
39:42.345 --> 39:43.665
I'll stay at a colleague's place.

300
39:45.105 --> 39:45.985
It's fine.

301
39:47.025 --> 39:48.745
I can sleep on the sofa.

302
39:50.305 --> 39:52.105
You can get a good night's sleep in a bed.

303
39:52.185 --> 39:53.305
Why sleep on a sofa?

304
39:54.505 --> 39:56.625
Don't worry about imposing on me. I'm happy to do it.

305
39:56.705 --> 39:59.225
My colleague's apartment is very close to the research institute,

306
39:59.305 --> 40:01.185
so it's actually much more convenient for me.

307
40:01.265 --> 40:02.345
But you…

308
40:03.145 --> 40:04.985
You'll have a longer commute to school now,

309
40:05.065 --> 40:06.305
so you'll have to wake up early.

310
40:07.985 --> 40:09.105
I'll get some clothes.

311
40:09.745 --> 40:10.945
Make yourself at home.

312
40:28.785 --> 40:30.105
I've put on fresh sheets.

313
40:33.785 --> 40:36.065
Just relax and stay here. It's very safe.

314
40:36.705 --> 40:38.425
If you need anything, just call me.

315
40:38.505 --> 40:39.545
I'll come right over.

316
40:40.905 --> 40:42.945
It's late. Get some rest.

317
40:46.465 --> 40:47.825
Chen Yanzhou.

318
40:50.865 --> 40:51.985
Stay here tonight.

319
41:01.385 --> 41:03.385
During the time you were away,

320
41:04.665 --> 41:06.025
I missed you so much.

321
41:09.385 --> 41:10.225
I…

322
41:11.625 --> 41:12.825
missed you too.

323
41:20.185 --> 41:21.945
Even though I missed you so much,

324
41:22.825 --> 41:24.505
I kept holding back and never said it.

325
41:27.025 --> 41:29.745
Chen Yanzhou. I don't want to hold back anymore.

326
41:31.425 --> 41:32.545
I…

327
42:40.785 --> 42:42.025
It's getting late.

328
42:42.105 --> 42:43.985
I'll go get the bed ready for you.

329
43:01.225 --> 43:02.305
You take the bed.

330
43:03.505 --> 43:04.385
What about you?

331
43:04.465 --> 43:05.865
The sofa.

332
43:09.705 --> 43:11.385
Here's a new pillow.

333
43:11.465 --> 43:12.385
Oh right.

334
43:12.465 --> 43:15.465
The bedroom is a little small, so watch your head.

335
43:25.105 --> 43:26.545
I'm so annoyed!

336
43:27.625 --> 43:28.825
What's wrong?

337
43:28.905 --> 43:30.625
I've been binge-watching a drama lately.

338
43:30.705 --> 43:33.745
It's already absurd that the leads don't get together until the last two episodes.

339
43:33.825 --> 43:36.385
At the end of one episode, the mood was completely right,

340
43:36.465 --> 43:38.265
yet the male lead stopped mid-kiss!

341
43:38.345 --> 43:41.545
And then nothing even happened! That is beyond ridiculous!

342
43:41.625 --> 43:42.465
Why?

343
43:42.545 --> 43:44.025
Why else?

344
43:44.105 --> 43:45.785
Because that man is obviously the problem!

345
43:45.865 --> 43:47.025
Zheng Yu.

346
43:56.945 --> 43:59.745
Your reaction makes it look like you've got a guilty conscience.

347
44:04.785 --> 44:05.985
I brought a nightlight for you.

348
44:06.065 --> 44:07.785
If you need to use the bathroom at night,

349
44:07.865 --> 44:09.785
you can turn it on so you don't bump into anything.

350
44:11.385 --> 44:14.785
Here's a charging cable for your phone. In case you left without bringing one.

351
44:14.865 --> 44:17.705
And one more thing. Here are the keys to the front door and bedroom.

352
44:17.785 --> 44:18.865
Keep them.

353
44:21.985 --> 44:23.385
Bedroom key…

354
44:24.785 --> 44:26.945
You keep it. I won't go in.

355
44:31.905 --> 44:32.785
Get some rest.

356
45:51.265 --> 45:52.625
DORM 223 LET'S GO

357
45:52.705 --> 45:55.465
Isn't it the middle of the night in Berlin right now?

358
45:55.545 --> 45:58.105
Zheng Yu, what are you doing up so late?

359
45:58.185 --> 45:59.865
She must be sleepwalking.

360
45:59.945 --> 46:02.465
XU FANGLI: @ZY

361
46:03.985 --> 46:05.585
I sent it by mistake.

362
46:11.065 --> 46:13.985
And here I thought you were really interested in this topic!

363
46:37.745 --> 46:40.625
Zheng Yu, why did you stop replying?

364
46:40.705 --> 46:41.665
Zheng Yu?

365
46:42.185 --> 46:43.505
Be honest.

366
46:43.585 --> 46:45.625
Did you really just send that by mistake?

367
49:11.825 --> 49:16.825
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
